---
import { screenshots } from '../data/screenshots';
---
<div class="published-preview"><div class="published-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">INSIDE THE VENDBI MOBILE APP</p><h3>Your operation, on screen.</h3></div><span class="published-label">PUBLISHED APP SCREENSHOTS</span></div><p class="published-intro">Explore dashboard, stock, machine and reporting views from the official VendBI app listings. Select a screenshot to see the full image.</p><div class="app-screenshot-track" role="region" aria-label="VendBI app screenshot gallery, scroll to explore" tabindex="0">{screenshots.map(shot=><figure><a href={shot.src} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={`View full-size ${shot.title} screenshot (opens a new tab)`}><img src={shot.src} width={shot.width} height={shot.height} alt={`VendBI ${shot.title.toLowerCase()}: ${shot.description}`} loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></a><figcaption><strong>{shot.title}</strong><a href={shot.listing}>Published on {shot.source} ↗</a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="preview-caption">Screenshots as published in VendBI’s app listings. Displayed figures are listing examples, not customer results. Available functions depend on your machine setup and software version.</p></div>
